        <DDBankConfirmation>&lt;p class='Text'&gt;Your first payment of &amp;pound;%CALCULATEDFIRSTPAYMENTAMOUNTPENCE% will be taken by us on or just after %CALCULATEDFIRSTPAYMENTDATE%.  This payment consists of:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&amp;pound;%MONTHLYMEMBERSHIPFEEPENCE% membership fee&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&amp;pound;%JOININGFEEPENCE% %JoiningFeeDescription%&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class='Text'&gt;Subsequent monthly payments of &amp;pound;%MONTHLYMEMBERSHIPFEEPENCE% will commence on %CALCULATEDSECONDPAYMENTDATE% and will continue on or just after the same day of each month thereafter&lt;/p&gt;</DDBankConfirmation>
        <AgreeingToText>You are committing to a single &amp;pound;%JOININGFEEPENCE% %JoiningFeeDescription% payment and a further &amp;pound;%MONTHLYMEMBERSHIPFEEPENCE% per month for a minimum of %CONTRACTLENGTHMONTHS% months. After this minimum term your membership payments will continue on a monthly basis.</AgreeingToText>
